":"86398","synopsis":"Akitsu used his powers to undo the carnage inflicted by the mysterious Death Spreader, but all that did was literally buy everyone some time. Ryo once again invites Lall and Eko to work with Gozekai toward uncovering the mysteries behind the KamiErabi.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10720161/screencap/67208651c4b81.jpg"},{"title":"So Don`t Cry, It`ll Be Okay","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18334","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"172199","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56967","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"222798","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432749","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"86492","synopsis":"Chika has been comatose ever since the 828 Incident twelve years ago, and her friend Ryo has faithfully taken care of her all that time. But with the Death Spreader on the move again, will it be too late even if she does wake up?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10720162/screencap/6729b64726b71.jpg"},{"title":"If You Want to Save the World, Just Tap That Smartphone","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18334","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"172199","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56967","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"222798","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432749","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"86588","synopsis":"The Death Spreader seems hopelessly unbeatable, so the God candidates use a combined attack to seal him away in one of Ryo's parallel worlds. Within it, he shows Lall and Kyo his memories of how KamiErabi first came to be--including who created it.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10720163/screencap/6732f5e395c6f.jpg"},{"title":"I Thought Up My Own Lines","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18334","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"172199","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56967","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"222798","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432749","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"86671","synopsis":"Higaki reveals to Lall and Kyo some game-changer secrets about the KamiErabi and the very nature of the world. A race against time then begins as both the parallel world they're inside and the world from which they came begin to collapse.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10720164/screencap/673c3597855c6.jpg"},{"title":"I Mean, of Course, It`s... Me","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18334","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"172199","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56967","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"222798","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"432749","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"86759","synopsis":"After a narrow escape from the parallel world, the remaining God candidates make their way to the facility housing the KamiErabi AI. But then an unexpected guest appears, and she literally flips the script on everyone.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10720165/screencap/67458656c43c6.jpg"},{"title":"Everything Turned Out Like This Because You Wanted It To","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18334","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist",